[Info]
Name	The Breach
Description	Two portals only, but the waves come fast and they do not stop coming. Skirmish. Somewhere in the rock, veterans of an old hero company camp in a ruin, sitting on the gold they took with them.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
